[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4227014146","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118372#issuecomment-4227014146","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118372","id":4227014146,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc778x4C","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-10T21:54:47Z","updated_at":"2026-04-10T21:54:47Z","body":"I noticed a similar issue when profiling Engraving (https://store.steampowered.com/app/2616650/Engraving/) which I fixed locally by switching to WTP. In the end Raffa fixed the issue by baking his Noisetextures in the editor (which is almost always a better option).\r\n\r\n@smix8 has run into the same problem and proposed an alternative approach in #110765 ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4227014146/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4228535624","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118372#issuecomment-4228535624","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118372","id":4228535624,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc78ClVI","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-11T07:26:37Z","updated_at":"2026-04-11T07:26:37Z","body":"> smix8 has run into the same problem and proposed an alternative approach in 110765\r\n\r\nThe reasoning for the singleton was that you will run into performance issues and thread-stuck issues when throwing to many complex noise textures at the WorkerThreadPool.\r\n\r\nThere is no working prioritization of threads tasks. If you load many noise textures without a loading screen you will have performance issues, especially when they are at higher resolutions.\r\n\r\nThe immediately waiting for finish to join the thread task on the main thread with deferred queue can also cause main thread stutter processing so many updated noise resource at the same time.\r\n\r\nBy using a singleton that collects finished tasks each engine loop iteration gradually you can avoid most of those issues.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4228535624/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4239859232","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118372#issuecomment-4239859232","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118372","id":4239859232,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc78tx4g","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-13T21:50:48Z","updated_at":"2026-04-13T21:50:48Z","body":"> There is no working prioritization of threads tasks. If you load many noise textures without a loading screen you will have performance issues, especially when they are at higher resolutions.\r\n\r\nThe PR using low-priority tasks for NoiseTextures, so this shouldn't be a problem. Anything that is being waited on in the frame uses high priority tasks\r\n\r\n> The immediately waiting for finish to join the thread task on the main thread with deferred queue can also cause main thread stutter processing so many updated noise resource at the same time.\r\n\r\nI agree, this is still a big problem and something that users can't control. \r\n\r\nWhat do you think about merging this in the meantime since this is strictly an improvement over the current state of things?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4239859232/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4251348109","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118372#issuecomment-4251348109","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118372","id":4251348109,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc79ZmyN","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-15T10:46:06Z","updated_at":"2026-04-15T10:46:06Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4251348109/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]